      "body": "## Purpose\n\nPrefix-repetition datasets return nine prompts when asked for ten across three prefixes. Distribute the remainder so no requests are dropped. Searches for PrefixRepetitionRandomDataset and prefix-repetition request counts found no competing fix.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n`.venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/benchmarks/test_random_dataset.py -k prefix_repetition -q`\n\n## Test Result\n\nLocal command: `vllm/.venv/bin/python verify_prefix_requests.py`. All four CPU cases pass; two fail before. This harness executes the source classes and regression test with a real GPT-2 tokenizer. Full vLLM runtime and GPU tests were not run on this Mac. Pre-commit and Python 3.12 mypy pass.\n",
